   "facing": "down",
   "behavior": "idle",
   "talkable": true,
   "say": [
    "Tansy Brasswhistle, tinker! Mind the owl. He's not finished. Well, he's finished. He just doesn't know it.",
    "Gnomes and dwarves built half this city together. Dwarves did the heavy bits. We did the clever bits."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "kesh",
   "role": "wispcatcher",
   "name": "Kesh, mine-runner",
   "pos": [
    4.4,
    -3.2
   ],
   "facing": "down",
   "behavior": "idle",
   "talkable": true,
   "say": [
    "I'm Kesh! I run the carts. Well, the carts run. I hang on. Want a ride? It's free. Mostly.",
    "Cave orbs follow you if you stand still. I stood still for an hour once. I had nine."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "haldis",
   "role": "poolkeeper",
   "name": "Old Haldis",
   "pos": [
    5.6,
    5.6
   ],
   "facing": "left",
   "behavior": "idle",
   "talkable": true,
   "say": [
    "Mind the lanternfish. That orange one's Ember. He's ninety. He's earned the good spot.",
    "Fish glow, frogs glow, moss glow. Down here, if you don't glow, you're furniture."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "dw_a",
   "role": "elffolk",
